OL,5,G2200 Paramedics
OL,6,     FBrand new series: Medics battle to
OL,7,     Fsave a woman who's having a severe
OL,8,     Fasthma attack and is fighting for
OL,9,     Fher life. And the helicopter crew
OL,10,     Frace to the scene of a horror car
OL,11,     Fcrash.
OL,12,G2300 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FThere's a variety of sport and
OL,14,     Fdrink-related injuries on the
OL,15,     FSaturday shift. And when a family
OL,16,     Fparty goes horribly wrong, a dad
OL,17,     Fand son sustain life-threatening
OL,18,     Finjuries.
