OL,5,G0005 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FWilliam has broken his leg in
OL,7,     Fthree places. Nick's fallen from a
OL,8,     F10-metre ladder onto concrete. And
OL,9,     FWilfred, who lives alone, has had
OL,10,     Fa nasty accident while cutting
OL,11,     Fvegetables.
OL,12,G0105 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FThe heli-medics attend a car crash
OL,14,     Fin Northumberland, and treat a man
OL,15,     Fwith a dangerously fast heartbeat
OL,16,     Fand a cyclist who's had a nasty
OL,17,     Fcrash in a remote part of Cumbria.
